{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete the following terms:\nGO:0051283 | negative regulation of sequestering of calcium ion\nGO:0051284 | positive regulation of sequestering of calcium ion\nGO:0051282 | regulation of sequestering of calcium ion\nGO:0038098 | sequestering of BMP from receptor via BMP binding\nGO:0035582 | sequestering of BMP in extracellular matrix\nGO:0051208 | sequestering of calcium ion\nGO:0035581 | sequestering of extracellular ligand from receptor\nGO:0038101 | sequestering of nodal from receptor via nodal binding\nGO:0038105 | sequestering of TGFbeta from receptor via TGFbeta binding\nGO:0035583 | sequestering of TGFbeta in extracellular matrix\nGO:0043181 | vacuolar sequestering\nGO:0043182 | vacuolar sequestering of sodium ion\n\nThese should be replaced by [molecular sequestering activity](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0140313) or a child.\nThe BP should be 'negative regulation' of the BP mediated by the target.\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/30777\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1OJyo1xz68gdjYqDLqW9_c2o8calo3WVxTalPam0o4yc/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \nAgBase 3 - done\nBHF-UCL 15 - done\nCACAO 1\ndictyBase 1\nFlyBase 3\nMGI 2\nRGD 1\nTAIR 2\nUniProt 12 -done\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2025-09-30T22:13:31Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "closed", "state_reason": "completed", "title": "Review annotations to sequestering BPs", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-05-20T07:48:26Z"}
